      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean the privacy stuff sounds important but it feels like a lot of people just use it as an excuse to block progress. like, isn't the security aspect basically a solved problem that's just objectively better for everyone? why do people keep making it such a huge debate if the benefits for safety are so clear?",
